sequenceDiagram
    participant Doctor
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant QO as QueueOrchestrator
    participant ES as EncountersService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Doctor->>Web: Press "Patient is here — start"
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/start-consultation with Idempotency-Key and If-Match
    API->>QO: startConsultation
    QO->>DB: Lock queue session and entry, check transition called to in_consultation
    QO->>ES: ensureForQueueEntry inside the same transaction
    ES->>DB: Find encounter by queue_entry_id, insert one if missing
    QO->>DB: Write queue event and outbox row, commit
    API-->>Web: Entry result plus encounterId
    Web->>API: GET /encounters/:id/workspace
    API-->>Web: Encounter, treatments, queue entry token and version, doctor
    Web-->>Doctor: Consultation workspace opens
    Doctor->>Web: Types notes
    Web->>API: PATCH /encounters/:id after 0.8 s pause
    API->>DB: Update only the fields sent
